          "caption": {
            "has_translation": null,
            "created_at": 1779381073,
            "pk": "18095356370054721",
            "text": "Keke Palmer Earned Her Crown 👑\n\nOn the eve of the Met Gala, PAPER caught up with the one and only @keke, mere weeks before her next flick I Love Boosters directed by the Boots Riley, and stepping in as chief @larocheposayusa officer.\n\nNot only that, did we mention she’s the architect of workout service, “Practice by Palmer?” Busy, busy girl! \n\nAt the #linkinbio, we caught up with Palmer about all things community, bringing people together, and more. \n\nAll skincare by @larocheposayusa \n\nphotography @williejane\nstyling @mollyddickson\nmakeup artist @basedkenken\nhair artist @iamhairbyhe\nart department @allegras1mone \nstory @joansummers4ever \n\nlighting director @funeraldrip\nmovement support @a_rucker\nphoto assistant @audryanacruz\non-set stylists @paigeholtz , @kelliecage\nstylist interns @jadonjoukar, @tuanamerhart\ntailor Franco\n\nchief creative officer @briancalle \npresident @jasonve \nvp of brand partnerships @jamiemissy \nexecutive creative director @_jordanbradfield\nexecutive creative producer @angelinacantu\nsr.editor @joansummers4ever\non site producer @officialricardodiaz\ngraphic design @compositeco"
          },
