            "text": "Keke Palmer has spent nearly two decades building one of the most versatile careers in entertainment.\n\nIn Collider’s latest profile, Palmer reflects on I Love Boosters, working with Boots Riley, the evolution of her career from child star to producer and host, and why authenticity remains at the center of everything she does. ✨\n\nRead the full profile now.\n\n📸 Photographer: @selashiloni\n💇 Hair: @viphair_ashanti\n💄 Makeup: @basedkenken\n👗 Styling: @mollyddickson\n✍️ Writer: @bamfpire\n📝 Editors: @westlifebunny & @woeisjoe\n🎨 Design: @konawi28\n🎬 Creative Director: @morgantakesmanhattan\n📍 Location: Four Seasons Beverly Hills"
